Thanks to all our support who made this possible - Co-Captains Stephanie Strong and Becky Pham, Bike Officers Kelly Strader,  Charla Reese, Patrick Scales, Stephanie Baker, and Dan Lyons,Team Consultant.  
J. Paul Oxer, Camp Designer & Director, Heather Choate, Volunteer Captain, Sarita Garza, Bellville Lunch Captain,  Amy Moore, Austin Finish Captain, Randy Gross, Head Chef, assisted by Lyndel Click, and Sandy Flowers and Albert Lopez, who directed Team Enron Massage Therapy.  We absolutely could not have done this in such comfort without all these wonderful people, and we really appreciate all of them and the many, many more they inspired and directed to make this event work.

Special thanks to the corporate support we received from Sarah Davis & Angela Sprock, Community Relations and Laura Schwartz, Public Relations.   

THANKS TO ALL OF YOU FOR RIDING WITH ENRON!  OBVIOUSLY, WE WOULDN'T EVEN HAVE A TEAM WITHOUT YOU RIDERS!  THANK YOU, THANK YOU, THANK YOU, AND WE HOPE YOU'LL BE BACK FOR A RE-RIDE IN 2002. MARK THE DATES - APRIL 20-21, 2002!!!

