X-From: Amelia Alder
X-To: Amelia Alder <Amelia Alder/OTS/Enron@ENRON>
X-cc: David_K_Smith <David_K_Smith@reliantenergy.com>, pete markey <pete markey/ENRON@enronXgate>, pat.bertotti <pat.bertotti@txh.nmss.org>, mark.neagli <mark.neagli@txh.nmss.org>
X-bcc: 
