Subject: Important Announcement Regarding Document Preservation
Mime-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=us-ascii
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit
X-From: Jim Derrick@ENRON
X-To: All Enron Worldwide@ENRON
