Hi, Stephanie.

To unsubscribe from the list, please do the following:

1.  Send an e-mail to:  LISTSERV@LIST.RTOWEST.ORG

2.  In the BODY of the e-mail, types the words "SIGNOFF RRGA-L"

3.  Make sure there is NO OTHER TEXT AT ALL in the body of the e-mail you
send (such as a sender signature).

This will take you off the list.

My apologies for the inconvenience and annoyance.

- Sarah

