Mary,

Good luck to you!  I think I remember you saying that you could just as
easily live in New England.

I'm glad we worked together enough for me to get to know you!  I've been to
the NEISO several times, and you'll likely run into other TCA'ers out there.
I look forward to seeing you again sometime soon.  And if I or others at TCA
can be of assistance (either formally, or informally) feel free to let me
know.

Best wishes!
Ellen.



